only two of them.

00:04:31.290 --> 00:04:34.520
You don't want to list out 18,
you only want to list the two,

00:04:34.520 --> 00:04:35.913
so you can include the 18.

00:04:35.913 --> 00:04:38.330
So in order to create that
function, all we're going to do

00:04:38.330 --> 00:04:41.690
